title: PostSneak
// Corresponds to scene 4 in the narrative script
// This scene is from Ruzica's POV
// Ruzica and Jovan are the characters in these scene
// Ruzica is character 1, Jovan is character 2
---
<<twoChar>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: OK, we made it out of the city.
<<darken 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: Where do we go now?
<<darken 2>>
<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: I don’t know. Let’s just keep walking until we find somewhere safe.
<<darken 1>>
They spent the next month hopping from town to town, unable to settle down.
===

title: ApptScene
---
{$lover1Name} and {$lover2Name} are standing in the middle of their newly leased apartment.

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: It’s been too long since I’ve heard from Damir.
<<darken 2>>
<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: I’m sure he’s alright. We ran away, remember?
{$lover2Name}: I’ve been worried too, but it’s not a good idea to reach out again right now.
<<darken 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: I just want to know he’s alright. I haven’t stopped thinking about it.
<<darken 2>>
<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: We have to put our life back together first.
{$lover2Name}: I want to know as much as you do.
<<darken 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: He deserves to know we’re safe too, don’t you think everyone back home is worried about us?
<<darken 2>>
<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: You might be right.
{$lover2Name}: This is our home now, but I see your point.
<<darken 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: I’ll send a letter to Damir. You should send one to your parents, and then we can put it behind us.
===
